{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One holiday, the father Haruma came to the park with his daughter Naori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in that park, strange things began to happen\u2014.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out the holiday mission \u201cPlaying House\u201d for your beloved daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>What is Playing House</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generally, it is a kind of pretend play where children imitate the adults around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game System</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player experiences the story from the first-person perspective of the father, Haruma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wedding Chapter, Pet Chapter, and other missions according to the \u201cPlaying House Guidebook.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various errands and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confrontations with sudden intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome them all and see Naori\u2019s \u201cspecial Playing House\u201d through to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two endings \u201cin the game.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the language from the gear icon at the bottom left after starting the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Play Time</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all endings is estimated to take about 4\u20136 hours of playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About Video Recording and Live Streaming</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please get Naori-chan\u2019s permission in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naori-chan is kind, so she\u2019ll probably say OK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><u><strong>//Hint</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock Ending 2, you must complete the special conditions in each mission and reach Mission 6.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After collecting the flags, just clear the mission as usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The collection status is shown next to the Mission button on the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please complete the special conditions in order, starting from Mission 1.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Voice Cast</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naori \u2014 Touru Mito</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maino \u2014 Touru Mito</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Mission Success: Wedding Episode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/5c02e58f51c1588742c492963360d533c4ea8d07.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Success: Office Episode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/a5f9f64bb27b561549d5353aed49eb5180c11a1f.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Success: Baby Episode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/895e98b4e61e803d73c18a41e4f920c55135055d.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Success: Pet Episode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/42b7657f23d65163ba6f2d636a3f73b9071f45aa.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Success: School Episode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/0466d71695f69155e8c89f288f88b9ccd0141ab8.jpg"},{"name":"Mission Success: Birthday Episode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/da426b682a7a5379b55417096e31e100e1925a9e.jpg"},{"name":"32-Year-Old\u2019s Serious Playing House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/018a53b330cff962b3ce9e029b5224edcacebbcb.jpg"},{"name":"Resounding Scream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3560990/7a34fd1fc7b9ceab94106d6e9d3e3b9ba21a1fb