 holiday, the father Haruma came to the park with his daughter Naori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in that park, strange things began to happen\u2014.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out the holiday mission \u201cPlaying House\u201d for your beloved daughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>What is Playing House</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generally, it is a kind of pretend play where children imitate the adults around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game System</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player experiences the story from the first-person perspective of the father, Haruma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wedding Chapter, Pet Chapter, and other missions according to the \u201cPlaying House Guidebook.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various errands and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confrontations with sudden intruders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome them all and see Naori\u2019s \u201cspecial Playing House\u201d through to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two endings \u201cin the game.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can change the language from the gear icon at the bottom left after starting the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Play Time</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all endings is estimated to take about 4\u20136 hours of playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>About Video Recording and Live Streaming</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please get Naori-chan\u2019s permission in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naori-chan is kind, so she\u2019ll probably say OK.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><u><strong>//Hint</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock Ending 2, you must complete the special conditions in each mission and reac